  "howto": {
   "fill": "blue",
   "page": "tables",
   "text": "The Shifts boards are live and drawn in Tender, retail's theme. Press Play on any of them:\n\n\u2022 Tick rows: the toolbar turns into the selection's actions and a tinted line in the footer sums them.\n\u2022 Group: State puts the rows under headings that carry their own subtotals.\n\u2022 Filters opens the filters that are not on the row; its badge counts the ones in use.\n\u2022 Scroll the table: the header and the totals stay pinned, and Back to top appears in the pager.\n\u2022 The 1024px board shows the folding: View holds sort, group and columns; Filters takes Till and Cashier; Till, Duration and Opened step out of the table.\n\u2022 Tweaks \u203a theme switches the live board between Tender, Tender dark and Corelith.\n\nAll figures are sample data.",
   "w": 360,
   "x": 5664,
   "y": 0
  },
