   "text": "Read top to bottom.\n\n1. The index: the golden path from signup to first sale, the eight areas, and the rules every workflow follows.\n2. Areas 01 to 04: everything that gets a shop ready to sell.\n3. Areas 05 to 08: everything that happens once it is selling.\n\nEach card is one workflow: who does it, where it starts, its steps, and links to its screens on the other pages. Grey \"Next\" cards are mapped but not yet drawn.\n\nPress Play on the index to click through.",
